{"id":"temperamento","lemma":"temperamento","pos":"noun","rank":4938,"glosses":["temperament"],"ipa":"/tempeɾaˈmento/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"temperamentos"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/b/b8/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-temperamento.wav","examples":[{"text":"Él pierde el temperamento con facilidad.","en":"He loses his temper easily.","words":[{"g":"he"},{"g":"to lose","l":"perder"},{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"with"},{"g":"ease"}]},{"text":"Tom tiene un temperamento violento.","en":"Tom has a violent temper.","words":[null,{"g":"to have","l":"tener"},{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"violent"}]},{"text":"A pesar de ser insultado, él consiguió mantener su temperamento.","en":"In spite of being insulted, he managed to keep his temper.","words":[null,null,null,{"g":"to be"},{"g":"to insult, offend","l":"insultar"},{"g":"he"},{"g":"to achieve","l":"conseguir"},{"g":"to keep"},{"g":"his / her / your"},null],"phrases":[[0,3,"in spite of, despite"]]},{"text":"¿No te avergüenzas de ti mismo por haber perdido el temperamento así?","en":"Aren't you ashamed of yourself for having lost your temper like that?","words":[{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"to shame","l":"avergonzar"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"you","l":"tú"},{"g":"same"},{"g":"for / by"},{"g":"to have"},{"g":"lost"},{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"like this"}]},{"text":"Tom hizo lo que pudo para controlar su temperamento.","en":"Tom did his best to keep temper under control.","words":[null,{"g":"to do","l":"hacer"},null,null,{"g":"to be able to, can","l":"poder"},{"g":"for"},{"g":"to control, to rein in"},{"g":"his / her / your"},null],"phrases":[[2,4,"what, that which"]]}]}